Package: BatchBO
Type: Package
Title: Batch-Aware Bayesian Optimization for Laboratory Experiments
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      given = "Mathias",
      family = "Brevik",
      email = "matbre17@gmail.com",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: Provides a batch-aware Gaussian-process workflow for sequential
    optimization of laboratory experiments. The package supports space-filling
    starting designs, mixed-effects Gaussian-process fitting, batched
    acquisition functions, reproducible run sheets, recommendations, global
    sensitivity analysis, response-surface visualization, and retrospective
    monitoring of experimental improvement.
